{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2023-06-01 11:45:00', 'title': 'MEDIAN TECHNOLOGIES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE 2023 ASCO ANNUAL MEETING, JUNE 2-6, 2023, MCCORMICK PLACE, CHICAGO, IL, USA', 'text': 'SOPHIA ANTIPOLIS, FRANCE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MEDIAN TECHNOLOGIES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE 2023 ASCO ANNUAL MEETING, JUNE 2-6, 2023, MCCORMICK PLACE, CHICAGO, IL, USA.'}{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2023-06-01 08:00:00', 'title': "MCCORMICK APPOINTS ANA SANCHEZ, ANDREW FOUST, AND KASEY JENKINS TO THE COMPANY'S MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE", 'text': "HUNT VALLEY, MD. , JUNE 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE: MKC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FLAVOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ANA SANCHEZ, PRESIDENT-EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA (EMEA), ANDREW FOUST, PRESIDENT-AMERICAS, AND KASEY JENKINS, CHIEF GROWTH OFFICER, TO ITS MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE, THE COMPANY'S HIGHEST LEADERSHIP TEAM."}